neximageeditor (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewrite in C++17 with Qt6 Widgets (no Python, no OpenCV).
  * Photoshop-style layout: menus, options bar, toolbox, document tabs,
    Layers / Properties / History panels, status bar.
  * Tools: rectangle/ellipse/lasso marquee, magic wand, move (including
    selected pixels), brush, eraser, paint bucket, gradient, eyedropper,
    crop, free transform, raster text, rectangle/ellipse shapes, zoom, hand.
  * Undo/redo for every edit; layer blend modes and opacity.
  * Adjustments (brightness/contrast, hue/saturation, levels, tint, invert,
    grayscale) and filters (Gaussian blur, unsharp mask, median, noise) with
    live preview.
  * Image/canvas size, rotate and flip.
  * Import/export PNG, JPEG, WebP, BMP, TIFF; save/load .nxe projects.
  * Removed from 1.x: curves, presets, background removal, OpenCV sharpen,
    text/shape vector layers.

 -- hyggshidev@gmail.com  Fri, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0700
